bodyText:
Dataset description
Dataset containing 40 millions of hdfs log entries, available here.
Size: 13GB.
Example of a log entry formatted for quickwit
{
  "timestamp": 1460530013,
  "severity_text": "INFO",
  "body": "PacketResponder: BP-108841162-10.10.34.11-1440074360971:blk_1074072698_331874, type=HAS_DOWNSTREAM_IN_PIPELINE terminating",
  "resource": {
    "service": "datanode/01"
  },
  "attributes": {
    "class": "org.apache.hadoop.hdfs.server.datanode.DataNode"
  }
}

Indexing performance

Documents Read: 40069452 Parse Errors: 0  Published Splits: 9 Dataset Size: 14003MB Throughput: 45.32MB/s
Indexed 40069452 documents in 5.15min

Split generated: 8 with 5 million docs and 1 with 69452 docs on apple M1.
Typically, for 1 split, we have:

.term: 11MB
.fast: 13MB
hotcache: 129MB
.store: 413MB
.idx: 108MB

